@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Background";
}
<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="mb-5">Our Background</h1>
</div>

<div>
    <p class="mt-5">
        JCL was founded in 2026 by a group of three students who wanted to improve on the audio industry by creating the products that consumers have been asking for.
        Named after its three founders, Jacob Stover, Caleb Day, and Luke Hinson, the company was first conceptualized when the three got together for a group project analyzing the work of other audio companies.
        Having their own ideas for how to improve the industry, they decided to start their own company to bring their ideas to life. Our CEO is Jacob Stover, our COO is Caleb Day, and our CFO is Luke Hinson.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-5">
        JCL follows the Manufacturer Direct business model to deliver products directly to consumers, without the need for a middleman. Our e-business types are Direct-to-Consumer
        and Business-to-Consumer, using our online platform as a primary sales channel to reach customers. 
    </p>
    <p class="mt-5">
        JCLs Business Process Model for purchasing a product is as follows:
    </p>
    <ol>
        <li>Navigate to the home page.</li>
        <li>Click on the Products tab at the top of the page.</li>
        <li>Find an item you would like to purchase and click the Add to Cart button.</li>
        <li>Click the button that says Checkout.</li>
        <li>Fill out the Adress fields. <br />
            <ul>
                <li>Enter the 3 lines of your address (if applicable).</li>
                <li>Enter the city of your address.</li>
                <li>Enter the state of your address.</li>
                <li>Enter the ZIP code of your address.</li>
                <li>Enter the country you live in.</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>Fill out the Payment fields. <br />
            <ul>
                <li>Enter the name on your credit card.</li>
                <li>Enter your credit card number.</li>
                <li>Enter the expiration date of your credit card.</li>
                <li>Enter the security code of your credit card.</li>
                <li>Enter your billing address.</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>Click the Complete Order button.</li>
        <li>If you would like to check the status of your order, click the Track Order button. <br />
            <ul>
                <li>Enter your orderID into the box and click the submit button.</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
    </ol>
</div>